'''''Strife, Dispel the Accompanying Fears''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Light Slips the Gate, Shadow Greets the Throne]].

==Steps==
# Await Phainon at the Vortex of Genesis
# Speak with Aglaea and interfere with the trial
# Interfere with the trial
# Return to your private bath chamber and discuss the present circumstances with Dan Heng

