:'''Divine Echo:''' "That white-haired warrior knew he was no match for me, yet he chose to fight till his very last breath..."
:'''Divine Echo:''' "What about you, Mydeimos? Can your murderous intent match up to what fate has in store for you!?"
:'''Divine Echo:''' "In the name of fairness, I grant you the blood of Strife!"
:'''Divine Echo:''' "Prove to me that you are worthy of this power!"
:'''Divine Echo:''' "In fear you shall abandon your mortal body, King of Kremnos!"
:'''Divine Echo:''' "You shall rise from suffering, young god!"
